The FindAsync call was not awaited, which caused the method to
return Ok(ValueTask<Events>) instead of Ok(Events). This also meant
the null check never executed, so a missing event returned HTTP 200
instead of HTTP 404.

- Add await to _context.Events.FindAsync(EventID)
- Ensure the null check runs and NotFound() is returned when the
  event does not exist

